# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts): a required place must fit the declaration of the code: the x of D is a
# size_t, the x of S an int. The admission fails at run time with the implicit call throw; D\x keeps 7. Entry 7.
S:
    int: x
    x: x + 1
end: S
D:
    size_t: x 7U
end: D
fn: run () int
    int: r 82
    call: S D
    catch: call ()
        r: 83
        if: D\x = 7U
            r: 7
    ---
return: r
int: got run()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
